  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7c1e5a9d3b2f4e08a6d4f1b9c0e2a735, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CardGameTutorial
  onlyWhenStartedFromStarQuest: 1
  forceRunInEditor: 1
  battleManager: {fileID: 426697763}
  openingFlagField: isOpeningSequenceActive
  openingFallbackDelay: 6
  openingMaxWait: 15
  defaultPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a0a48ebf8b8fc5d42941af87cfb1c01f, type: 3}
  fontSource: {fileID: 320521827}
  dimColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0.8}
  frameColor: {r: 0, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  frameThickness: 4
  mergeHighlights: 1
  overlaySortingOrder: 32000
  charsPerSecond: 70
  nextLabel: Next
  lastStepLabel: Got it!
  skipLabel: Skip tutorial
  pauseGame: 1
  wonFlagField: hasPlayerWon
  lostFlagField: hasPlayerLost
  requireWin: 0
  sections:
  - id: enemy-and-score
    trigger: 0
    visibleTarget: {fileID: 0}
    visibleGroup: {fileID: 0}
    worldCamera: {fileID: 288812202}
    delayAfterReady: 0.5
    steps:
    - speaker: Bee
      text: This is your opponent. To win, you have to out-score its defence before
        the rounds run out.
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      highlight:
      - {fileID: 1126097986}
      padding: 24
    - speaker: Bee
      text: This is the enemy's strength. The 'x' number multiplies its defence,
        so a bigger number means a tougher fight.
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      highlight:
      - {fileID: 1880390504}
      - {fileID: 664313841}
      padding: 20
    - speaker: Bee
      text: This is the Score to Beat, the enemy's defence. Your total score has
        to reach it. If you hit the enemy with a card before the fight, this number
        starts lower.
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      highlight:
      - {fileID: 2103308114}
      - {fileID: 1230810601}
      padding: 20
    - speaker: Bee
      text: You only get a limited number of rounds. If you haven't reached the Score
        to Beat by the last round, the enemy wins.
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      highlight:
      - {fileID: 1863097499}
      - {fileID: 1534126438}
      padding: 20
    - speaker: Bee
      text: Press this button to open your hand of cards and start scoring.
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      highlight:
      - {fileID: 877066048}
      padding: 24
  - id: player-advantage
    trigger: 1
    visibleTarget: {fileID: 2124731805}
    visibleGroup: {fileID: 2124731811}
    worldCamera: {fileID: 0}
    delayAfterReady: 0.6
    steps:
    - speaker: Bee
      text: Welcome to the Player Advantage roll! Your shield is on the left and
        the enemy's shield is on the right.
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      highlight:
      - {fileID: 1776458615}
      - {fileID: 1771863016}
      padding: 24
    - speaker: Bee
      text: Click your shield to roll a number from 1 to 20.
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      highlight:
      - {fileID: 1776458615}
      padding: 24
    - speaker: Bee
      text: Roll higher than the enemy and you earn an advantage that boosts your
        score. Roll lower and it works against you. If the two numbers are very close,
        it's a tie.
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      highlight:
      - {fileID: 354425064}
      - {fileID: 2087629742}
      padding: 24
    - speaker: Bee
      text: When you're done here, press Back to return to the battle.
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      highlight:
      - {fileID: 962202701}
      padding: 20
  - id: card-system
    trigger: 1
    visibleTarget: {fileID: 2064940597}
    visibleGroup: {fileID: 0}
    worldCamera: {fileID: 1239587810}
    delayAfterReady: 1.2
    steps:
    - speaker: Bee
      text: These are your cards. Click a card to select it, and drag cards around
        to rearrange your hand.
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      highlight:
      - {fileID: 1660299530}
      padding: 20
    - speaker: Bee
      text: Your score is Power times multiplier. The cards you pick add the chips,
        while your roll advantage and bonuses boost the multiplier.
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      highlight:
      - {fileID: 1915275747}
      - {fileID: 860585526}
      padding: 24
    - speaker: Bee
      text: And here's the Score to Beat again. Keep an eye on it while you build
        your hand.
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      highlight:
      - {fileID: 1760928008}
      padding: 24
    - speaker: Bee
      text: This shows how many cards you've selected, and how many are left in your
        deck.
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      highlight:
      - {fileID: 2015069719}
      - {fileID: 1180298868}
      - {fileID: 1378936278}
      padding: 20
    - speaker: Bee
      text: Play scores the cards you've selected.
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      highlight:
      - {fileID: 112385958}
      padding: 24
    - speaker: Bee
      text: Reshuffle swaps cards you don't want for fresh ones. You only get a few
        of these, so use them wisely.
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      highlight:
      - {fileID: 1134774081}
      padding: 24
    - speaker: Bee
      text: Back takes you to the battle screen. Good luck out there!
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      highlight:
      - {fileID: 566403907}
      padding: 24
